<p> Current     prft 275 million	 vs   loss 481 million</p>
<p> Net	   prft 225 million	 vs   loss 505 million</p>
<p> EPS	    prft 14.95 yen	  vs    loss 33.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares		15 million	 vs	   15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanjo Machine Works Ltd is the largest maker of tobacco-processing machines.</p>
